 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "addSong(title) stores a song and returns its id; ids are 1, 2, 3, ... in call order and never reused; titles may repeat. playSong(songId, userId) records that the user played the song (void). getAnalytics() returns [title, number of DISTINCT users who played the song] for every song, sorted by that count descending, ties by smaller song id (output form and tie rule inferred). Level 2 adds getLastThreeSongs(userId): the ids of the (up to) three most recently played DISTINCT songs of that user, most recent first; an unknown user gets [] (method name and id output inferred).",
